---
---

<section class="cs-section">
	<div class="container cs-inner">

		<!-- ── Left: speech bubble + author ── -->
		<div class="cs-left">

			<!-- Speech bubble card -->
			<div class="speech-bubble">
				<p class="quote-text">
					The amount of pictures we're able to get back in such a short amount of time
					is one of the things we absolutely love about Path. We're able to photograph
					all of our products and submit for editing in the same evening.
					<strong>We wake up to the edited images the next day, and they're perfect.</strong>
					We have the freedom to shoot products on any surface with any lighting because
					we know Path will come through and deliver consistent, quality imagery every time.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Author row: big quote mark + name/title -->
			<div class="author-row">
				<!-- Double quotation mark icon — light blue/purple -->
				<svg class="quote-icon" width="40" height="32" viewBox="0 0 40 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
					<path d="M0 32 L0 18 C0 8 5 2 16 0 L18 4 C12 6 9 10 9 14 L16 14 L16 32 Z" fill="#9D91F5" opacity="0.5"/>
					<path d="M22 32 L22 18 C22 8 27 2 38 0 L40 4 C34 6 31 10 31 14 L38 14 L38 32 Z" fill="#9D91F5" opacity="0.5"/>
				</svg>
				<div class="author-info">
					<strong class="author-name">Alee Mills</strong>
					<span class="author-title">Director of Operations, Ice Cream Castles</span>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>

		<!-- ── Right: headline + read link + photo ── -->
		<div class="cs-right">

			<h2 class="cs-heading">
				See how Ice Cream Castles reduced their
				<strong>product photo turnaround from 1 week to 1 day with Path</strong>
			</h2>

			<a href="/blogs/tips/ice-cream-castles" class="cs-read-link">
				Read story
			</a>

			<figure class="cs-photo">
				<img
					src="https://cdn.pathedits.com/Images/pages/home/ice-cream-castles-product-photo-path.png"
					alt="Three children in matching patterned outfits — Ice Cream Castles"
				/>
			</figure>

		</div>

	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cs-section {
		background: #ffffff;
		padding: 80px 0 60px;
	}

	/* Two-column layout */
	.cs-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 64px;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	/* ── Left column ── */
	.cs-left {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	/* Speech bubble — light blue border, white bg, bottom-left tail */
	.speech-bubble {
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1.5px solid #c5d8f5;
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 32px 36px;
		position: relative;
	}

	/* Triangle tail at bottom-left (border layer) */
	.speech-bubble::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		bottom: -22px;
		left: 44px;
		border-left: 13px solid transparent;
		border-right: 13px solid transparent;
		border-top: 22px solid #c5d8f5;
	}

	/* Triangle tail fill (white layer on top) */
	.speech-bubble::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		bottom: -18px;
		left: 46px;
		border-left: 11px solid transparent;
		border-right: 11px solid transparent;
		border-top: 18px solid #ffffff;
		z-index: 1;
	}

	/* Quote text */
	.quote-text {
		font-family: 'Asap', sans-serif;
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.72;
		color: #332b50;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.quote-text strong {
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #332b50;
	}

	/* Author row — sits below the bubble */
	.author-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 28px;
	}

	.quote-icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.author-info {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3px;
	}

	.author-name {
		font-family: 'Livvic', sans-serif;
		font-size: 18px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #2b1b9a;
	}

	.author-title {
		font-family: 'Asap', sans-serif;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: #5f5572;
	}

	/* ── Right column ── */
	.cs-right {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 14px;
		padding-top: 8px;
	}

	/* Heading: regular weight intro + bold key phrase */
	.cs-heading {
		font-family: 'Livvic', sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(20px, 1.65rem, 28px);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: #2b1b9a;
		line-height: 1.35;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.cs-heading strong {
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	/* "Read story" underlined link */
	.cs-read-link {
		font-family: 'Asap', sans-serif;
		font-size: 15px;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: #2b1b9a;
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
		width: fit-content;
	}

	.cs-read-link:hover { color: #9b93ee; }

	/* Photo — no border-radius, matches screenshot */
	.cs-photo {
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 0;
	}

	.cs-photo img {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
	}

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.cs-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 48px;
		}
	}
</style>
